# BuildKit reads this file for deploy/netplay-server/Dockerfile (context = repo root).
# Only the Cargo workspace goes in: cargo needs every member manifest + sources to load
# the workspace, even though only netplay-server is compiled.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!apps/runner
!apps/netplay-server
!apps/launcher/src-tauri
!crates
**/target
apps/launcher/src-tauri/gen
apps/launcher/src-tauri/icons
**/.env
**/*.log
